{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "eaf2106b417a6d6e4ec95782a3125d53304bbb4adfa9da362a7c02e0dc1f42e5", "ja": "『階のスターエレメンツ』、再び", "zh": "“阶的STAR ELEMENTS”，重现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6565aee938357d3a9e0466d1f0b3e0de9ef41328d956e5cb2fcdeb163f9eb9e6", "ja": "以前、未来、可奈、琴葉が出演したドラマ\n『階のスターエレメンツ』のスペシャル版の\n制作が決定。3人はドラマを見返しながら、\n当時のことを振り返る。光駆、水桜、星蘭は\nユニットを組んだものの、不仲だった。", "zh": "以前，未来、可奈和琴叶出演的电视剧《阶的Star Elements》确定制作特别篇。3人一边重温电视剧，一边回顾当时的经历。光驱、水樱和星兰虽然组成了组合，但彼此关系并不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "a9f6467d06e849931b10c4489e1900a1375827932fc0bbc99124ea5904eed19b", "ja": "ここまでが、ドラマ\n『階のスターエレメンツ』の前半か～……。", "zh": "到这里就是电视剧《阶梯的明星元素》的前半部分了啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b456866ec2a1b8ad2916bd822345264e11e6cea37d6417350ab4ce0323b8703", "ja": "今見ても、ハラハラするよね～！\nなんだか、私なのに私じゃないみたいだし……！", "zh": "就算现在再看，还是让人捏一把汗呢～！\n总觉得明明是我，却又不像是我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "44d5b17c846406fecbf2dcc6501e58d4c840b2ff5e8f8a8fa41242808daa2d64", "ja": "3人のキャラクターが、ものすごく立ってるよね。\n本当に、勉強させてもらったお芝居だったな。", "zh": "这3个人的角色形象，真的很鲜明呢。\n那次演戏，真的让我学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "234bd9ef0cea552ed2cee64de815cc9568a4dcdff0cdda94c28e64b6eabed4a9", "ja": "そうだな。『階のスターエレメンツ』は、\n今でもファンの人達の間で人気が高いみたいだ。", "zh": "是啊。《阶层的星光元素》直到现在似乎在粉丝们之间仍然很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "fafc0237d5c94ee355ab7a2bec559eec916af0509cf1cad3b46e3ef57fa0f0e9", "ja": "ここから水桜と光駆ちゃんと星蘭さんの3人が、同じ\n事務所に所属する事になって、ユニットを組んで……。", "zh": "接下来，水桜、光駆和星蘭这3个人会加入同一家事务所，组成组合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "71a68e7e3bd6a82e8b706c80bfbf106e5edada45a9257a909646d2f2ebbedee6", "ja": "はれ？　その後って、\nどうなるんでしたっけ……？", "zh": "咦？那之后会怎么样来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2c4f658f20ae82d0d436f5ec5ee91e6b78cd5e37e03fd95affbfeebf1a39c6f2", "ja": "前半のインパクトが強すぎるから……\nそれじゃ、続きを観てみようか。", "zh": "因为前半的冲击力太强了……\n那就继续看下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "748b0f143e1225efe3a5caf62fa4db8e785266782fd3ed0612a7a9ec886a7eec", "ja": "そうですね。せっかくなので、最後まで映像を見て、\nその時の感情を思い出したいです。", "zh": "是啊。机会难得，就把影像看到最后，回想一下当时的感受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1008_null", "source_sha256": "83a3b51dedfcef3beb1421bd3d8a3c21d6d8b9b22b9c77e7d66a6d2c9f3b92b5", "ja": "910プロダクション　レッスンスタジオ……", "zh": "910事务所　练习室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "8ff345011e19d6e1ae9b1eac23785190d1e73c44063e5f734a0368f5a6f7e7da", "ja": "はぅぅ、疲れた……。\n今日のレッスンも、厳しかったよ～……。", "zh": "呜呜，好累……。\n今天的训练也好严格啊～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "c0904e0e62ed81267530666ef84dc102e86c4f91444631ef6804994287abadd6", "ja": "ほんと、ドタバタうるさかった！\n気が散るったらないんだけど。", "zh": "真的，又吵又乱的！简直让人没法集中精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "80dd0ce34a917bd99303ac1e9c732e4e58c9566cb1d3c054043d7b48d727d1e7", "ja": "まだまだ体幹が弱いわね、天羽さんは。\nだから足元がふらつく。", "zh": "天羽同学的核心力量还很弱呢。\n所以脚步才会不稳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "17ee3d1d5b2dfc02dc962b6eebe8a7b4944b101730bd7add53e14156efa2413a", "ja": "体幹トレーニングをメニューに追加して、\nインナーマッスルを鍛えなさい。", "zh": "把核心肌群训练加入训练菜单，锻炼你的深层肌肉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "341dc647f5b7e8853e8399333c137b74cb40a4e1fbb7d42355ea3030ce3ae7aa", "ja": "うう、はい……。", "zh": "呜呜，好的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "08e8af62a4509eb0385e474395c253853ddde83b005add9c25ee5ebe8ab8859d", "ja": "ふっ。こんな事なら、オーディションの時、\n足ひっかけるまでもなかったのかもね。", "zh": "呵。早知道这样，试镜的时候或许都不用绊你一脚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb52c29ddd3cd421ca7bc979acd5592f4fd44235edd9817e97592e56d7a8da87", "ja": "あ、あれは！　足をひっかけたっていうか、\nむしろキックだったよ！　ローキック！", "zh": "啊、那是！与其说是绊了你一脚，不如说是踢——低踢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "1ebd2cf1193d768e5e8a38c16c3e8194a3f4f7efab334319dcaaf596b6c7dde6", "ja": "そんなことしてないわよ！\nまったく、大げさなんだから。", "zh": "我才没做那种事呢！\n真是的，太夸张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "09f140e64a92527b7694768674b94002bbf47febdf28d1fd4141de3982dd3a5c", "ja": "そんなことより、神崎さんは、振りに勝手なアレンジを\n入れないで。まずはダンスの精度を上げなさい。", "zh": "比起那个，神崎小姐，请不要擅自给舞蹈动作加入改编。先把舞蹈的精准度提高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "efbec39db40a39c8ba5d3b26f509400b84f7035d778f2c5dd94cbae46363989c", "ja": "は？　えらそうに……。\n大体、なんであんたが仕切ってんの？　草薙。", "zh": "哈？摆什么架子……再说了，凭什么由你来指挥啊，草薙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "1129dbcc08a3cf8d2c426bda2a2327f18ed05e4ae8ff84cd91fb5124b76a7199", "ja": "草薙のお嬢様だからって、誰もが言うことを\n聞くと思ったら、大間違いなんですけど！", "zh": "以为自己是草薙家的千金，就觉得谁都会听你的，那可就大错特错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "757b73c5c08689adf58cb74299138a438b07ff13dfd33d322e4fa1ff7c48d188", "ja": "そうね。同じユニットじゃなければ、あなたの\nみっともないダンスも、無視できたんだけど。", "zh": "是啊。要不是同一个组合，你那难看的舞蹈，我也可以当没看见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "3320dbeae0c80ca7996f461d86e8cefce2808c39e8c3786c330a43fdb33cd4ce", "ja": "っ……この！", "zh": "呃……你这家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "31feb58217626912c85a5727a38053c15ef604ae6df31e5da8fe90e87b68c226", "ja": "わわ、ケンカはダメだってば！　私たち『STAR \nELEMENTS』として、デビューが決まったんだし！", "zh": "哇哇，不可以吵架啦！我们可是已经决定要以『STAR ELEMENTS』的身份出道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "4deea5bfbb8c6331130ab132baffb369cd7d42400e33d8037cf5583a883a2aff", "ja": "これからは、3人で力を合わせていきましょう！\nえいえい、おー！", "zh": "接下来，我们3人一起齐心协力吧！\n加油，加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "fd527d7354ac983ae9d150b18f4b8a1c46cb998b42bf1e449419ed0d284e3b1e", "ja": "……。\n私、これで上がりまーす。お疲れさまでしたー。", "zh": "……\n我这就先走啦～辛苦各位了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "a55b7af84f3a50e448e5e1a9b6990fcf53edb9f21f7533bee3b9d808d583d147", "ja": "私は、自主練して帰るから。\nお先にどうぞ。", "zh": "我会自己练习完再回去。你先走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "4ca030140cf331ebb5bf239b462e85c1922f0efa2418291da6c9f8a3bfef21db", "ja": "うう……。\nユニット、こんな調子で大丈夫かなぁ……？", "zh": "呜呜……\n组合这样下去真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
